.SH NAME 
	rw - random walk through directory tree
.SH SYNOPSIS
	rw (no options)
.SH DESCRIPTION
	flips a coin to decide whether to go to a random child directory or the parent, unless at home, in which case it only goes up. 
.SH OPTIONS
	might make an option for how long to wait and where home should be 
.SH EXAMPLES
